                <pb facs="0569" n="445" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg445"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00/2753: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Morales</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-11-16T09:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                                1923—9 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 8:35 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>94. The President invited the three Presidential candidates to confer with him
                    yesterday afternoon. Carias refused to attend. The President, Arias and Bonilla
                    discussed the political situation for three hours but nothing was
                    accomplished.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Morales</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
